      "id": "u_1dde4b1f721cab130587b865_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Mermaid supports a different layout engine which supports slightly more complex diagrams, called the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Eclipse Layout Kernel (ELK)__TRILIUM_PH_1__. Trilium has support for these as well, but it's not enabled by default.",
